[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WAR]
Destiny is in the Claws of Changelings

[en.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WAR_desc]
What are the “destinies” the reindeers are talking about? Are they inescapable fates, or just hollow excuses made up to save their lives? Changelings don’t believe in destiny, for fate is fluid, destiny, is in the claws of changelings ourselves.

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WAR]
势在虫为

[zh.FOCUS_C11_REINDEER_WAR_desc]
驯鹿所谓的“命运”是什么？是一种无法逃脱的宿命，还是一种为保命而捏造出来的空洞说辞？幻形灵们不相信命运，命运流变，势在虫为。

